        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "Noted. For the above situation (Non NerdFonts, 'nvim-web-devicons' is installed, `section_fileinfo` active), it should be disabled because the double-width icons breaks the window rendering for some neovim frontend. We need to disable it for such a frontend.\r\n Thus, I change the behavior to return a blank string in the latest commits. Further, I agree the option name (`nerdfonts`) is not so general name. Hence, I have changed it to `use_icons`. Please check it.",
